      "countAsQuest:1": 1,
      "desc:8": "Every stage in the Vehicle Assembly Base is a §6fuel tank§r with a §6thruster§r under it. A few rules decide whether it flies:\n\n- A stage cannot have more thrusters than tanks, and the tank count must divide evenly between the thrusters.\n- The engine and the tank must use the same fuel. Only space-grade tanks accept any fuel.\n- Every stage above the first needs §6Landing Legs§r. A rocket that lands on a stage without legs topples over and explodes.\n- A rocket has at most 5 stages, and the payload on top must be a crewed capsule or a station core.\n\nThrust has to lift the whole rocket, and the specific impulse (ISP) decides how much fuel the trip takes. The assembly screen shows both, together with the fuel needed for the selected trip.",
